# wasm threads need cross-origin isolation. require-corp works even though the
# Hugging Face CDN sends no CORP header: the check only applies to no-cors loads,
# and the weights go through fetch() in cors mode with both hops CORS-ok.
# credentialless would be equivalent except in Safari, which does not support it.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
